      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One of these rare cases can be seen if you're attempting to scale your Avatar using Remeasure Avatar while tracking is disabled. Locally, you'll appear fine, but remote clients will see you either rising into the sky or sinking into the ground depending on if you're increasing or decreasing your scale respectively. I tested this using normalized time to control the animation, however that should not make any difference.",
      "viewerReactions": null
