  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-25T01:11:40.608Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After the new update, some systems that disable tracking to change the avatar state rely on Networked IK and don't work just the same as they did as when the avatar is viewed remotely. \nIn these rare cases, it'd be nice to have a state behavior to force an animation to play over networked IK, even if tracking is disabled for that state.",
